          "For the Outsourced Callers virtual assistant operations queue: They appear when the queue is measured by activity and the evidence standard is assumed. The fix is usually a smaller checklist and a clearer stop rule, not more reminders. Record the exception, the owner, and the next review date so the handoff stays visible. For the occ cross training map workflow, checkpoint 158 stays with the named owner and the verified close."
