          "At Outsourced Callers, the virtual assistant operations review starts here: Records are often kept forever because no one knows which ones can be deleted. The result is cost, privacy risk, and a review that cannot tell current records from obsolete ones. Put Outsourced Calling And Outreach Operations Records on a Retention and Disposal Schedule turns that situation into a bounded workflow with a source, one accountable owner, and a recorded close. Record the exception, the owner, and the next review date so the handoff stays visible. For the occ retention disposal workflow, checkpoint 194 stays with the named owner and the verified close.",
