          "In daily virtual assistant operations work at Outsourced Callers: Do not fill a blank from a familiar pattern. If a value is unknown, mark it unknown and route one precise question. A forwarded note is a lead, not proof; a clean status is not evidence. Test the rule on one ordinary item, one exception, and one unresolved case before expanding it. For the occ retention disposal workflow, checkpoint 197 stays with the named owner and the verified close."
