          "At Outsourced Callers, the virtual assistant operations review starts here: Name the systems the specialist may use, the fields they may change, and the questions they must route. A short written boundary is easier to audit than a general instruction to use good judgment. A second reviewer should be able to reconstruct the decision from the attached evidence. For the occ retention disposal workflow, checkpoint 199 stays with the named owner and the verified close."
