          "In Outsourced Callers's virtual assistant operations workflow: Sample a few items each week: one high value item, one exception, and one recently corrected item. If the same gap appears twice, fix the checklist or the source map before coaching the same person again. The reviewer checks the source, the named owner, and the next action before the item leaves the queue. For the occ retention disposal workflow, checkpoint 206 stays with the named owner and the verified close."
