          "In daily virtual assistant operations work at Outsourced Callers: The checklist is deliberately short. A long list will be skipped under volume. Use the same five checks for an ordinary case and an exception, and record the result in the queue rather than in a separate document. A second reviewer should be able to reconstruct the decision from the attached evidence. For the occ sla review workflow, checkpoint 340 stays with the named owner and the verified close."
